                "title": "Modern Leverset, Baldwin 5114",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5114 Lever With 5048 Rose - Designed with contemporary style, the Modern Baldwin Lever features concealed mounting (installation screws are hidden) for an ultra sleek look. The ridges in the handle makes this stylish 5114 lever and 5048 rose set have a current feel. It is constructed out of solid brass and will fit standard door preparations. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5114, Baldwin modern leversets, baldwin 5114 levers, baldwin 5048 roses, baldwin 5148 roses, solid brass leversets, modern levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin 5114 leversets, baldwin 5048 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, ada compliant levers, Baldwin 5114 Levers, Baldwin 5114 door Lever, Baldwin 5114 Modern Levers,"
